
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

read_data       relaxed.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0.0083151989 0.010886874 -0.035598674) to (41.039685 40.616097 42.191599)
  3 by 2 by 5 MPI processor grid
